              "desc": "春のBlue Eyed Soul<br />\n3.25のSATURDAY NIGHT VIBESは<br />\n先週のBobby Caldwell　に引き続き Blue Eyed Soulを特集します。<br />\n70年代の後半からAORのブームと共に人気となったジャンル<br />\n日本のCITY POPにも影響を与えたと言っても過言ではありません。<br />\n近年もAOR路線のサウンドも人気な中<br />\n是非皆さんのお気に入りの１曲教えてください。<br />\n番組HPまでリクエスト待ってます☆彡<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n番組は土曜深夜1時から。<br />\nTwitterの番組アカウント @snv813 をフォローしておいてください。<br />\nお知らせ届きます！<br />\n<br />\nタイムフリーでも聞いてね！！<br />\n<br />\n01:05 PEARLS / JESSIE WARE<br />\n01:08 I'M READY / FLAMINGO CARTEL AND DJ TARO/FEAT. ZORINA<br />\n01:16 GLOWING UP / LUKAS SETTO/FEAT. JULISA<br />\n01:20 I'LL BE AROUND / RAQUEL RODRIGUEZ AND NIGEL HALL<br />\n01:32 CUFF IT / BEYONCE<br />\n01:32 RELAX(NEW YORK REMIX) / FRANKIE GOES TO HOLLYWOOD<br />\n01:42 WHO YOU ARE / MIKE SABATH AND THE MOONGIRLS<br />\n01:45 I.G.Y. / DONALD FAGEN<br />\n01:49 WHATCHA GONNA DO? / PABLO CRUISE<br />\n01:52 IT DOESN'T HAVE TO BE THIS WAY / BLOW MONKEYS<br />\n01:56 I JUST WANT TO BE YOUR EVERYTHING / ANDY GIBB<br />\n02:04 WHAT A FOOL BELIEVES / DOOBIE BROTHERS<br />\n02:07 PRIVATE EYES / DARYL HALL AND JOHN OATES<br />\n02:09 ROLLING BACK / YOUNG GUN SILVER FOX<br />\n02:16 CLEAR / HUSH MOSS<br />\n02:19 MY EVER CHANGING MOODS(12 INCH VERSION) / STYLE COUNCIL<br />\n02:25 NEVER GONNA LET YOU GO / SERGIO MENDES<br />\n02:34 LOVE YOU INSIDE OUT / BEE GEES<br />\n02:37 IF I EVER LOSE THIS HEAVEN / AVERAGE WHITE BAND<br />\n02:40 WHY DON'T WE FALL IN LOVE / JOHN VALENTI<br />\n02:43 THE RIVER MUST FLOW / GINO VANNELLI<br />\n02:45 THERE MUST BE AN ANGEL(PLAYING WITH MY HEART) / EURYTHMICS<br />\n02:49 SIMONE / BOZ SCAGGS<br />\n02:53 WAITING FOR YOUR LOVE / TOTO<br />\n02:57 BIGGEST PART OF ME / AMBROSIA<br />\n",
